# Build outputs of the examples: the user's shared library, the cppgo-built shim
# beside each package, the locally built generator and the build/ trees.
#
# The generated *sources* (zz_cppgo.gen.go, zz_cppgo_amd64.s and cppgo_shim/) are
# committed on purpose: they are the example's teaching material, `make gen`
# reproduces them and `make check` proves they are current. Only the compiled
# objects are ignored.
build/
libcppgo_*.so
